WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:00,900
Now

2
00:00:01,190 --> 00:00:12,580
Let me protect you. What are you doing? Come on, brother, there is definitely a misunderstanding.

3
00:00:12,660 --> 00:00:18,480
Let's go back and stop first

4
00:00:18,960 --> 00:00:20,360
Do I allow you to go?

5
00:00:23,740 --> 00:00:25,380
A woman was left on fire in our car

6
00:00:25,620 --> 00:00:28,980
It was your base before

7
00:00:29,220 --> 00:00:30,980
If you like it, I'll give it to you

8
00:00:31,060 --> 00:00:32,980
We are all survivors helping each other, right?

9
00:00:33,060 --> 00:00:34,460
It's okay if you want to give me some supplies.

10
00:00:34,540 --> 00:00:36,180
That woman looks pretty good

11
00:00:38,330 --> 00:00:40,890
That woman used to be quite stubborn, and she had a special ability to hypnotize people into losing their minds.

12
00:00:40,970 --> 00:00:41,890
Fight loss with us

13
00:00:41,970 --> 00:00:44,450
I can't do it during this period of time. Just make some friends.
